  <h1>Sheet Music Shelf Internals</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">9,600 lines of Python across 41 modules. The shape of it follows from one decision — that a file is not a catalogue entry — and one promise: a person's judgement outranks the machine's, permanently.</p>
